msgid "Whether to use a light or dark theme, or automatically adjust the theme based on your system's settings."
msgstr "选择浅色或深色主题，或根据系统设置自动调整主题。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:30
msgid "Bookmark date format"
msgstr "书签日期格式"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:32
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Whether to show bookmark dates as relative (how long ago), or as absolute dates. Alternatively the date can\n"
"            be hidden.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            选择以相对日期（多久以前）还是绝对日期显示书签日期，也可以隐藏日期。\n"
"          "

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:38
msgid "Bookmark description"
msgstr "书签描述"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:41
msgid "Whether to show bookmark descriptions and tags in the same line, or as separate blocks."
msgstr "选择将书签描述和标签显示在同一行，还是分别显示为独立区块。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:45
msgid "Bookmark description max lines"
msgstr "书签描述最大行数"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:48
msgid "Limits the number of lines that are displayed for the bookmark description."
msgstr "限制书签描述的显示行数。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:52
msgid "Show bookmark URL"
msgstr "显示书签网址"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:54
msgid "When enabled, this setting displays the bookmark URL below the title."
msgstr "启用后，在标题下方显示书签的网址。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:58
msgid "Show notes permanently"
msgstr "始终显示备注"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:60
msgid "Whether to show bookmark notes permanently, without having to toggle them individually."
msgstr "选择是否始终显示书签备注，无需逐个展开。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:61
msgid "Alternatively the keyboard shortcut <code>e</code> can be used to temporarily show all notes."
msgstr "也可以使用快捷键 <code>e</code> 临时显示所有备注。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:65
msgid "Bookmark actions"
msgstr "书签操作"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:70
msgid "Which actions to display for each bookmark."
msgstr "选择每个书签要显示的操作。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:73
msgid "Open bookmarks in"
msgstr "书签打开方式"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:76
msgid "Whether to open bookmarks a new page or in the same page."
msgstr "选择在新页面还是当前页面打开书签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:80
msgid "Items per page"
msgstr "每页条目数"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:84
msgid "The number of bookmarks to display per page."
msgstr "每页显示的书签数量。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:88
msgid "Sticky pagination"
msgstr "固定分页控件"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:90
msgid "When enabled, the pagination controls will stick to the bottom of the screen, so that they are always visible without having to scroll to the end of the page first."
msgstr "启用后，分页控件将固定在屏幕底部，无需先滚动到页面末尾即可始终看到它们。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:94
msgid "Collapse side panel"
msgstr "折叠侧边栏"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:96
msgid "When enabled, the tags side panel will be collapsed by default to give more space to the bookmark list. Instead, the tags are shown in an expandable drawer."
msgstr "启用后，标签侧边栏默认折叠，为书签列表留出更多空间。标签会显示在可展开的抽屉中。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:100
msgid "Hide bundles"
msgstr "隐藏书签集"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:102
msgid "Allows to hide the bundles in the side panel if you don't intend to use them."
msgstr "如果不打算使用书签集，可以将其从侧边栏隐藏。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:106
msgid "Tag search"
msgstr "标签搜索"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:109
msgid "In strict mode, tags must be prefixed with a hash character (#)."
msgstr "在严格模式下，标签必须以井号（#）开头。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:110
msgid "In lax mode, tags can also be searched without the hash character."
msgstr "在宽松模式下，也可以不加井号搜索标签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:111
msgid "Note that tags without the hash character are indistinguishable from search terms, which means the search result will also include bookmarks where a search term matches otherwise."
msgstr "请注意，不带井号的标签无法与搜索词区分，因此搜索结果也会包含搜索词以其他方式匹配的书签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:115
msgid "Enable legacy search"
msgstr "启用旧版搜索"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:116
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Since version 1.44.0, linkding has a new search engine that supports logical expressions (and, or, not).\n"
"            If you run into any issues with the new search, you can enable this option to temporarily switch back to the old search.\n"
"            Please report any issues you encounter with the new search on <a href=\"https://github.com/sissbruecker/linkding/issues\"\n"
"    target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> so they can be addressed.\n"
"            This option will be removed in a future version.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            从 1.44.0 版本起，linkding 使用支持逻辑表达式（and、or、not）的新搜索引擎。\n"
"            如果使用新版搜索时遇到问题，可以启用此选项，暂时切换回旧版搜索。\n"
"            请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sissbruecker/linkding/issues\"\n"
"    target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> 上报告新版搜索的问题，以便修复。\n"
"            此选项将在未来的版本中移除。\n"
"          "

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:125
msgid "Tag grouping"
msgstr "标签分组"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:128
msgid "In alphabetical mode, tags will be grouped by the first letter."
msgstr "在字母模式下，标签将按首字母分组。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:129
msgid "If disabled, tags will not be grouped."
msgstr "禁用后，标签将不再分组。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:135
#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:138
msgid "Auto Tagging"
msgstr "自动标签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:142
msgid "Automatically adds tags to bookmarks based on predefined rules."
msgstr "根据预定义规则自动为书签添加标签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:143
msgid "Each line is a single rule that maps a URL to one or more tags. For example:"
msgstr "每行是一条规则，将网址映射到一个或多个标签。例如："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:149
msgid "Enable Favicons"
msgstr "启用网站图标"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:150
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Automatically loads favicons for bookmarked websites and displays them next to each bookmark.\n"
"            Enabling this feature automatically downloads all missing favicons.\n"
"            By default, this feature uses a <b>Google service</b> to download favicons.\n"
"            If you don't want to use this service, check the\n"
"            <a href=\"https://linkding.link/options/#ld_favicon_provider\"\n"
"               target=\"_blank\">options documentation</a> on how to configure a custom favicon provider.\n"
"            Icons are downloaded in the background, and it may take a while for them to show up.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            自动加载书签网站的图标，并显示在各个书签旁。\n"
"            启用此功能后，会自动下载所有缺失的网站图标。\n"
"            默认情况下，此功能使用 <b>Google 服务</b>下载网站图标。\n"
"            如果不想使用该服务，请参阅\n"
"            <a href=\"https://linkding.link/options/#ld_favicon_provider\"\n"
"               target=\"_blank\">选项文档</a>，了解如何配置自定义网站图标提供商。\n"
"            图标将在后台下载，可能需要一段时间才会显示。\n"
"          "

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:160
msgid "Refresh Favicons"
msgstr "刷新网站图标"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:164
msgid "Enable Preview Images"
msgstr "启用预览图"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:165
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Automatically loads preview images for bookmarked websites and displays them next to each bookmark.\n"
"            Enabling this feature automatically downloads all missing preview images.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            自动加载书签网站的预览图，并显示在各个书签旁。\n"
"            启用此功能后，会自动下载所有缺失的预览图。\n"
"          "

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:171
msgid "Internet Archive integration"
msgstr "互联网档案馆集成"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:173
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Enabling this feature will automatically create snapshots of bookmarked websites on the\n"
"            <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Internet Archive Wayback Machine</a>.\n"
"            This allows to preserve, and later access the website as it was at the point in time it was bookmarked, in\n"
"            case it goes offline or its content is modified.\n"
"            Please consider donating to the <a href=\"https://archive.org/donate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Internet Archive</a> if you make use of this feature.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            启用此功能后，将自动在\n"
"            <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">互联网档案馆时光机</a>上为书签网站创建快照。\n"
"            这样可以保存网站被加入书签时的内容，以便日后在网站下线或内容发生变化时仍能访问。\n"
"            如果您使用此功能，请考虑向<a href=\"https://archive.org/donate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">互联网档案馆</a>捐款。\n"
"          "

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:182
msgid "Enable bookmark sharing"
msgstr "启用书签共享"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:183
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Allows to share bookmarks with other users, and to view shared bookmarks.\n"
"            Disabling this feature will hide all previously shared bookmarks from other users.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            允许与其他用户共享书签，并查看共享的书签。\n"
"            禁用此功能后，其他用户将无法看到此前共享的所有书签。\n"
"          "

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:189
msgid "Enable public bookmark sharing"
msgstr "启用书签公开共享"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:191
msgid "Makes shared bookmarks publicly accessible, without requiring a login."
msgstr "使共享书签无需登录即可公开访问。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:192
msgid "That means that anyone with a link to this instance can view shared bookmarks via the"
msgstr "这意味着任何拥有此实例链接的人都可以通过以下页面查看共享书签："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:193
msgid "shared bookmarks page"
msgstr "共享书签页面"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:198
msgid "Automatically create HTML snapshots"
msgstr "自动创建 HTML 快照"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:200
msgid "Automatically creates HTML snapshots when adding bookmarks. Alternatively, when disabled, snapshots can be created manually in the details view of a bookmark."
msgstr "添加书签时自动创建 HTML 快照。禁用后，可以在书签详情视图中手动创建快照。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:202
msgid "Create missing HTML snapshots"
msgstr "创建缺失的 HTML 快照"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:206
msgid "Create bookmarks as unread by default"
msgstr "默认将新书签标记为未读"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:208
msgid "Sets the default state for the \"Mark as unread\" option when creating a new bookmark. Setting this option will make all new bookmarks default to unread. This can be overridden when creating each new bookmark."
msgstr "设置新建书签时“标记为未读”选项的默认状态。启用后，所有新书签默认标记为未读。创建每个书签时仍可单独更改。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:212
msgid "Create bookmarks as shared by default"
msgstr "默认共享新书签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:214
msgid "Sets the default state for the \"Share\" option when creating a new bookmark. Setting this option will make all new bookmarks default to shared. This can be overridden when creating each new bookmark."
msgstr "设置新建书签时“共享”选项的默认状态。启用后，所有新书签默认共享。创建每个书签时仍可单独更改。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:220
#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:222
msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "自定义 CSS"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:226
msgid "Allows to add custom CSS to the page."
msgstr "允许为页面添加自定义 CSS。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:240
msgid "Global settings"
msgstr "全局设置"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:247
msgid "Landing page"
msgstr "起始页面"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:250
msgid "The page that unauthenticated users are redirected to when accessing the root URL."
msgstr "未登录用户访问根网址时重定向到的页面。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:254
msgid "Guest user profile"
msgstr "访客用户配置"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:257
msgid "The user profile to use for users that are not logged in. This will affect how publicly shared bookmarks are displayed regarding theme, bookmark list settings, etc. You can either use your own profile or create a dedicated user for this purpose. By default, a standard profile with fixed settings is used."
msgstr "用于未登录用户的用户配置文件。这会影响公开共享书签的主题、书签列表设置等显示方式。你可以使用自己的配置文件，也可以为此创建专用用户。默认使用具有固定设置的标准配置文件。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:261
msgid "Enable prefetching links on hover"
msgstr "悬停时预加载链接"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:263
msgid "Prefetches internal links when hovering over them. This can improve the perceived performance when navigating application, but also increases the load on the server as well as bandwidth usage."
msgstr "悬停时预取内部链接。这可以提升应用导航时感知到的性能，但也会增加服务器负载和带宽使用量。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:277
msgid "Import"
msgstr "导入"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:279
msgid "Import bookmarks and tags in the Netscape HTML format. This will execute a sync where new bookmarks are added and existing ones are updated."
msgstr "以 Netscape HTML 格式导入书签和标签。这将执行同步，添加新书签并更新现有书签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:291
msgid "Import public bookmarks as shared"
msgstr "启用书签公开共享"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:294
msgid "When importing bookmarks from a service that supports marking bookmarks as public or private (using the <code>PRIVATE</code> attribute), enabling this option will import all bookmarks that are marked as not private as shared bookmarks. Otherwise, all bookmarks will be imported as private bookmarks."
msgstr "从支持将书签标记为公开或私有（使用 <code>PRIVATE</code> 属性）的服务导入书签时，启用此选项会将所有标记为非私有的书签作为共享书签导入。否则，所有书签都会作为私有书签导入。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:300
msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传文件"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:307
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:308
msgid "Export all bookmarks in Netscape HTML format."
msgstr "将所有书签导出为 Netscape HTML 格式。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:311
msgid "Download (.html)"
msgstr "下载（.html）"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:320
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:324
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:328
msgid "Links"
msgstr "链接"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:332
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "使用文档"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\general.html:334
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "更新日志"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:4
msgid "Integrations - Linkding"
msgstr "集成 - Linkding"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:8
#: .\bookmarks\templates\shared\nav_menu.html:39
#: .\bookmarks\templates\shared\nav_menu.html:99
msgid "Integrations"
msgstr "集成"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:10
msgid "Browser Extension"
msgstr "浏览器扩展"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:11
msgid "The browser extension allows you to quickly add new bookmarks without leaving the page that you are on. The extension is available in the official extension stores for:"
msgstr "浏览器扩展让你无需离开当前页面即可快速添加新书签。该扩展可在以下官方扩展商店中获取："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:15
msgid "Firefox"
msgstr "Firefox"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:19
msgid "Chrome"
msgstr "Chrome"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:22
msgid "The extension is <a href=\"https://github.com/sissbruecker/linkding-extension\" target=\"_blank\">open source</a> as well, which enables you to build and manually load it into any browser that supports Chrome extensions."
msgstr "该扩展也是<a href=\"https://github.com/sissbruecker/linkding-extension\" target=\"_blank\">开源的</a>，你可以自行构建并手动加载到任何支持 Chrome 扩展的浏览器中。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:23
msgid "Bookmarklet"
msgstr "书签小工具"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:24
msgid "The bookmarklet is an alternative, cross-browser way to quickly add new bookmarks without opening the linkding application first. Here's how it works:"
msgstr "书签小工具是一种跨浏览器的替代方式，无需先打开 linkding 应用即可快速添加新书签。使用方法如下："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:26
msgid "Choose your preferred method for detecting website titles and descriptions below (<a href=\"https://linkding.link/troubleshooting/#automatically-detected-title-and-description-are-incorrect\" target=\"_blank\">Help</a>)"
msgstr "在下方选择获取网页标题和描述的首选方式（<a href=\"https://linkding.link/troubleshooting/#automatically-detected-title-and-description-are-incorrect\" target=\"_blank\">帮助</a>）"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:27
msgid "Drag the bookmarklet below into your browser's bookmark bar / toolbar"
msgstr "将下方的书签小工具拖到浏览器的书签栏或工具栏中"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:28
msgid "Open the website that you want to bookmark"
msgstr "打开想要收藏的网站"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:29
msgid "Click the bookmarklet in your browser's toolbar"
msgstr "点击浏览器工具栏中的书签小工具"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:30
msgid "linkding opens in a new window or tab and allows you to add a bookmark for the site"
msgstr "linkding 将在新窗口或新标签页中打开，供您为该网站添加书签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:31
msgid "After saving the bookmark, the linkding window closes, and you are back on your website"
msgstr "保存书签后，linkding 窗口会关闭，您将返回原网站"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:36
msgid "Choose your preferred bookmarklet:"
msgstr "选择您偏好的书签小工具："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:43
msgid "Detect title and description on the server"
msgstr "在服务器上获取标题和描述"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:49
msgid "Detect title and description in the browser"
msgstr "在浏览器中获取标题和描述"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:55
#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:60
msgid "📎 Add bookmark"
msgstr "📎 添加书签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:89
msgid "REST API"
msgstr "REST API"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:94
msgid "Copy this token now, it will only be shown once:"
msgstr "请立即复制此令牌，它只会显示一次："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:96
msgid "New token key"
msgstr "新令牌密钥"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:105
#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:106
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:106
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "已复制！"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:110
msgid "API tokens can be used to authenticate 3rd-party applications against the REST API."
msgstr "API 令牌可用于第三方应用访问 REST API 时的身份验证。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:110
msgid "Please treat tokens as you would any other credential."
msgstr "请像对待其他凭据一样妥善保管令牌。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:110
msgid "Any party with access to a token can access and manage all your bookmarks."
msgstr "任何能够访问令牌的人都可以访问和管理你的所有书签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:119
msgid "Created"
msgstr "创建时间"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:171
msgid "RSS Feeds"
msgstr "RSS 订阅源"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:172
msgid "The following URLs provide RSS feeds for your bookmarks:"
msgstr "以下网址提供您的书签的 RSS 订阅源："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:175
msgid "All bookmarks"
msgstr "全部书签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:178
msgid "Unread bookmarks"
msgstr "未读书签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:181
#: .\bookmarks\templates\shared\nav_menu.html:83
#: .\bookmarks\views\contexts.py:285
msgid "Shared bookmarks"
msgstr "共享书签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:184
msgid "Public shared bookmarks"
msgstr "公开共享的书签"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:186
msgid "The public shared feed does not contain an authentication token and can be shared with other people. Only shows shared bookmarks from users who have explicitly enabled public sharing."
msgstr "公开共享订阅源不包含身份验证令牌，可以与他人共享。它仅显示明确启用了公开共享的用户所共享的书签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:189
msgid "Feed URLs support the following URL parameters:"
msgstr "订阅源网址支持以下网址参数："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:191
msgid "A <code>limit</code> parameter for specifying the maximum number of bookmarks to include in the feed. By default, only the latest 100 matching bookmarks are included."
msgstr "<code>limit</code> 参数指定订阅源中包含的书签数量上限。默认仅包含最新的 100 个匹配书签。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:192
msgid "A <code>q</code> URL parameter for specifying a search query. You can get an example by doing a search in the bookmarks view and then copying the parameter from the URL."
msgstr "<code>q</code> URL 参数指定搜索查询。你可以在书签页面搜索后，从 URL 中复制该参数作为示例。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:193
msgid "An <code>unread</code> parameter for filtering for unread or read bookmarks. Use <code>yes</code> for unread bookmarks and <code>no</code> for read bookmarks."
msgstr "<code>unread</code> 参数筛选未读或已读书签。<code>yes</code> 表示未读，<code>no</code> 表示已读。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:194
msgid "A <code>shared</code> parameter for filtering for shared or unshared bookmarks. Use <code>yes</code> for shared bookmarks and <code>no</code> for unshared bookmarks."
msgstr "<code>shared</code> 参数筛选共享或未共享的书签。<code>yes</code> 表示共享，<code>no</code> 表示未共享。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:195
msgid "A"
msgstr "一个"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:195
msgid "user"
msgstr "user"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:195
msgid "parameter for filtering bookmarks by user name. Only applies to the shared bookmark feeds."
msgstr "参数用于按用户名筛选书签，仅适用于共享书签订阅源。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:198
msgid "Please note that these URLs include an authentication token that should be treated like any other credential."
msgstr "请注意，这些 URL 包含身份验证令牌，应像其他凭据一样妥善保管。"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:199
msgid "Any party with access to these URLs can read all your bookmarks. If you think that a URL was compromised you can delete the feed token for your user in the"
msgstr "任何能够访问这些 URL 的人都可以读取你的所有书签。如果你认为某个 URL 已泄露，可以在以下位置删除用户的订阅源令牌："

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:200
msgid "admin panel"
msgstr "管理面板"

#: .\bookmarks\templates\settings\integrations.html:201
msgid "After deleting the feed token, new URLs will be generated when you reload this settings page."
msgstr "删除订阅源令牌后，重新加载此设置页面时会生成新的 URL。"

